    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/1ad41dbe2ec860db8a5b5023970c8afc.poster.avif?t=1739223004\" width=800 height=171 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/1ad41dbe2ec860db8a5b5023970c8afc.webm?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>A mystical 2D action-platformer where you play as a mysterious hero with a flaming skull and a cursed sword. Explore dark pixel-art worlds, battle dangerous enemies, and uncover the secrets of the underworld. The game features dynamic combat, atmospheric visuals, and an immersive dark fantasy setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/196d277096c1ced8001b5e42831f1457.avif?t=1739223004\" width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete a level, you'll need to solve engaging puzzles, wield powerful magic, and explore hidden secrets in search of the coveted key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/d10625e2b8216e93dfa8fbf759843f43.poster.avif?t=1739223004\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/d10625e2b8216e93dfa8fbf759843f43.webm?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/d10625e2b8216e93dfa8fbf759843f43.mp4?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/cd0ee4b122feff37c7dfbc6d4d524d80.poster.avif?t=1739223004\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/cd0ee4b122feff37c7dfbc6d4d524d80.webm?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/cd0ee4b122feff37c7dfbc6d4d524d80.mp4?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Don't forget to add Grim Blade to your wishlist!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/46a286f949069d77ca7147381c469750.poster.avif?t=1739223004\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/46a286f949069d77ca7147381c469750.webm?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/1ad41dbe2ec860db8a5b5023970c8afc.poster.avif?t=1739223004\" width=800 height=171 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/1ad41dbe2ec860db8a5b5023970c8afc.webm?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>A mystical 2D action-platformer where you play as a mysterious hero with a flaming skull and a cursed sword. Explore dark pixel-art worlds, battle dangerous enemies, and uncover the secrets of the underworld. The game features dynamic combat, atmospheric visuals, and an immersive dark fantasy setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/196d277096c1ced8001b5e42831f1457.avif?t=1739223004\" width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete a level, you'll need to solve engaging puzzles, wield powerful magic, and explore hidden secrets in search of the coveted key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/d10625e2b8216e93dfa8fbf759843f43.poster.avif?t=1739223004\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/d10625e2b8216e93dfa8fbf759843f43.webm?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/d10625e2b8216e93dfa8fbf759843f43.mp4?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/cd0ee4b122feff37c7dfbc6d4d524d80.poster.avif?t=1739223004\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/cd0ee4b122feff37c7dfbc6d4d524d80.webm?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/cd0ee4b122feff37c7dfbc6d4d524d80.mp4?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Don't forget to add Grim Blade to your wishlist!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/46a286f949069d77ca7147381c469750.poster.avif?t=1739223004\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440960/extras/46a286f949069d77ca7147381c469750.webm?t=1739223004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
